      <title>商家隐瞒关键信息致消费者错失购车补贴，法院判赔1.3万元</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/geek001/post/20260906/%E5%95%86%E5%AE%B6%E9%9A%90%E7%9E%92%E5%85%B3%E9%94%AE%E4%BF%A1%E6%81%AF%E8%87%B4%E6%B6%88%E8%B4%B9%E8%80%85%E9%94%99%E5%A4%B1%E8%B4%AD%E8%BD%A6%E8%A1%A5%E8%B4%B4%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E5%88%A4%E8%B5%941.3%E4%B8%87%E5%85%83/</link>
